# Step 1 - Create a Dockerfile

Inside your `frontend/` folder:

```bash
touch Dockerfile
```

Paste this into `frontend/Dockerfile`:

```dockerfile
FROM node:22-alpine

WORKDIR /app

COPY package*.json ./

RUN npm install

COPY . .

EXPOSE 5173

CMD ["npm", "run", "dev", "--", "--host"]
```

Why `--host`?

Normally Vite only listens on:

```text
localhost
```

Inside Docker that's inaccessible from your Mac.

This makes Vite listen on:

```text
0.0.0.0
```

so Docker can expose it.

