## Why Compose is useful

Before today, you needed:

```bash
docker run ...
docker run ...
```

Now it's just:

```bash
docker compose up
```

One command starts your entire application. As your project grows, adding more services is straightforward. For example:

```yaml
services:
  frontend:
  backend:
  postgres:
  redis:
```

Those additional services will all come up together with the same `docker compose up` command.

